damaged_code:
```rust
pub struct Engine {
    pub oil_level: i32,
}
struct Car {
    engine: Engine,
}
impl Car {
    fn drive(&mut self) {
        // Direct mutation of another struct's internal state field
        self.engine.oil_level -= 1;
    }
}
```

fix:
Encapsulate the mutation inside a method on the target struct.
```impl Engine {
    fn consume_oil(&mut self, amount: i32) {
        self.oil_level -= amount;
    }
}
```
